* ''Terra reads at the punctures'' (operator, 2026-11-05, replacing 2026-11-04's Sol for the final wiki lanes). One cold Terra read seat (`gpt-6.1-terra`, high effort, read mode, briefed blind) reads a lane's diff before its hand-back wherever the lane touches capability, custody or caps paths; the lead cures its findings red-first; a blind Opus reader collides with it on any custody-touching path. The Codex pool's build floor decides whether the seat runs, and below it the Opus read stands alone.

